    @Gosub Path:Act02_Chapter05/Act02_Chapter05_TrialInit
    @HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Duration:0 Reset:true
    @ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@SetTrialTimer Time:900
@HideUI UINames:ControlPanel AllowToggle:false
@ShowUI UINames:DebateUI

; クリーチャー初期化処理
@HideActors ActorIds:Hiro Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Position:{hiroPositionX},{characterPositionY},{hiroPositionZ} Rotation:,{hiroRotationY} Scale:{characterScale},{characterScale},1 Duration:0 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.1

; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 10-1: 💬 魔女化について
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論10-1 魔女化について
; 議論開始カットイン
; BGM変更：rAwTell Owk...
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge10-1-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ま、魔女化とは……<br>大魔女様に付与された<br>【魔女因子】が<br>覚醒することです。|#0205Trial01_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:魔女因子を持って<br>生まれた少女は<br>体質が合えば<br>魔法が使えるようになります。|#0205Trial01_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"そして少女の<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_01_01\">精神が魔女化</link>することで、<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_01_02\">肉体もまた魔女と化す</link><br>のです。|#0205Trial01_Meruru003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:その行き着く先は<br>【なれはて】……。|#0205Trial01_Meruru004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【なれはて】とは、<br>魔女因子が魂を食い尽くした<br>魔女の抜け殻のようなものです。|#0205Trial01_Meruru005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Smile_Closed1,Mouth1_Flushed_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:魔法も使えない、<br>ただのお人形……。|#0205Trial01_Meruru006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:魔女因子が魂を喰らい尽くすと<br>魔女化して定着した<br>一部の因子を残して<br>その肉体を離れます。|#0205Trial01_Meruru007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,Mouth1_Smile_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そして離れた魔女因子は<br>輪廻転生のように<br>新たな少女へと<br>移っていくんです。|#0205Trial01_Meruru008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head2,ArmR5_2,ArmL5,Eyes2_Downcast_Open1,Mouth2_Smile_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……で、でも私は……<br>そんな魔女化してできた<br>魔女とは<br>違う存在で――。|#0205Trial01_Meruru009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head2,ArmR1_2,Eyes2_Downcast_Open1,Mouth2_Smile_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"――最後に残った<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_01_03\">【原初の魔女】</link>なんです。|#0205Trial01_Meruru010|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.17
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【原初の魔女】……？|#0205Trial01_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:この島にはその昔、<br>大魔女さまと共に<br>【原初の魔女】たる<br>大勢の魔女が住んでいました。|#0205Trial01_Meruru011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"【原初の魔女】とは、<br>元からこの島に<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_01_04\">住んでいた者</link>たち……。|#0205Trial01_Meruru012|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Smile_Closed1,Mouth1_Smile_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"魔法を操る、<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_01_05\">上位の存在</link>なんです……。|#0205Trial01_Meruru013|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

